(7393026, 1160677, 61396, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Luciemac:</b></div><hr/><i> Huge crop needed....all that reflecting water really distracts from the flower. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>I actually like looking for the flowers better than finding them.</td>', 'Originally posted by Luciemac: Huge crop needed....all that reflecting water really distracts from the flower.  I actually like looking for the flowers better than finding them.', '2015-07-28 13:19:50.000000', NULL, 0),
